### 
### Variables Config
@vehiclesUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles


### Get all vehicles
# Ojo: sacale la barra "/" del final si tu @RestController no termina en mapping con "/"
GET {{vehiclesUrl}}
Accept: application/json


### Create a new vehicle
POST {{vehiclesUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "ABC123",
  "year": 2026,
  "category": {
    "id": 1
  }
}